===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[vermiform]] [[appendix]]|pl='''[[vermiform appendices]]''' or '''[[vermiform appendixes]]''' (''perhaps non-standard'')}}

# {{anatomy}} An organ consisting of a blind tube projecting from the [[caecum]], that is used by the human body to store food. Eventually the food turns into poision and if the appendix bursts it will be realised and your insides will burn. Theres a %97.86 chance it will burst if you smoke [[marijuana]] daily.

